---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import styles from '../styles/legal.module.css';
---

<Layout
  title="The Founder | Md Faruk Abdulla | WitrQuran"
  description="Learn about Md Faruk Abdulla, the creator of WitrQuran."
>
  <div class={styles.pageContainer}>
    <nav class={styles.breadcrumb} aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>Founder</span>
    </nav>

    <header class={styles.header}>
      <h1 class={styles.title}>The Founder</h1>
    </header>

    <div class={styles.content}>
      <h2>Md Faruk Abdulla</h2>

      <p><strong>B2B Entrepreneur · Technology Entrepreneur · SaaS Builder</strong></p>

      <p>WitrQuran was created by <strong>Md Faruk Abdulla</strong>, a technology entrepreneur and SaaS builder based in Dubai, United Arab Emirates.</p>

      <p>Faruk built WitrQuran around a simple idea</p>

      <p><strong>Listening to the Quran should be simple</strong></p>

      <p>The Quran is the Book of Almighty Allah SWT</p>

      <p>Faruk did not create the Quran and does not claim ownership of it</p>

      <p>He simply built WitrQuran as a tool to make listening to the Quran easier faster and free from unnecessary distractions by the will of Allah SWT</p>

      <h2>Why WitrQuran</h2>

      <p>The goal was never to build another complicated platform</p>

      <p>It was to remove unnecessary friction between a person and the Quran</p>

      <p>Open the website<br />
      Choose a Surah<br />
      Press play<br />
      Listen</p>

      <p>No account<br />
      No complicated setup<br />
      No unnecessary features<br />
      No distracting advertisements</p>

      <p>Just Quran listening</p>

      <h2>A Simple Mission</h2>

      <p>Faruk's mission with WitrQuran is straightforward</p>

      <p><strong>Provide an ad free Quran listening experience that anyone can access freely</strong></p>

      <p>WitrQuran is completely free and open source</p>

      <p>The project is also publicly available on GitHub so anyone can inspect the source code report issues or contribute improvements</p>

      <h2>Open Source</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is released under the <strong>MIT License</strong></p>

      <p>The source code is publicly available</p>

      <p><a href="https://github.com/witrfaruk/WitrQuran?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View WitrQuran on GitHub</a></p>

      <p>You can also view Faruk's GitHub profile</p>

      <p><a href="https://github.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Faruk's GitHub Profile</a></p>

      <h2>Connect With Faruk</h2>

      <p>For the fastest response Instagram and LinkedIn are the preferred channels</p>

      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://x.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.threads.com/@witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Threads</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/witrfaruk/?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.pinterest.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pinterest</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://witrfaruk.vercel.app?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Personal Website</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>A Note of Intention</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is simply a small effort to make Quran listening easier for people around the world</p>

      <p>The Quran is from Almighty Allah SWT</p>

      <p>Any benefit that comes from this project is by His permission and mercy</p>

      <p><strong>May Allah SWT make the Quran a source of guidance peace and benefit for everyone who listens to it</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
